    <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] mb-3" style="color: rgb(var(--accent))">Playbook</div>
    <h1>The swarm build playbook: ten templates, and the break each one prevents.</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-lg" style="color: rgb(var(--muted))">The conductor prompt, unit contract, verifier rubric, merge lock, deploy watcher and budget card behind two product builds in October 2026. Decoy names, real numbers.</p>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm" style="color: rgb(var(--muted))">The numbers are frozen on 12 October 2026. The story, with the failures in order, is in <a href={`${base}/chapters/58-conductor-never-codes/`}>Chapter 58</a>.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="container-wide pb-24">
